msgid "PERSONA_1008_NAME"
msgstr "Detached"

msgid "PERSONA_1009_DESC"
msgstr ""
"You are used to cultivating alone among mountains and marshes, and nothing "
"annoys you more than dealings with the court."

msgid "PERSONA_1009_NAME"
msgstr "Reclusive Cultivator"

msgid "PERSONA_1010_DESC"
msgstr ""
"You are willing to step into the mortal world and temper yourself and your "
