msgid "PERSONA_1011_NAME"
msgstr "Orthodox Gentleman"

msgid "PERSONA_1012_DESC"
msgstr ""
"You care a lot about your appearance and spend effort grooming yourself so "
"you look more presentable."

msgid "PERSONA_1012_NAME"
msgstr "Beauty-Conscious"

msgid "PERSONA_1013_DESC"
msgstr ""
"You care intensely about your appearance and almost treat becoming better-"
"looking as an obsession."

msgid "PERSONA_1013_NAME"
msgstr "Self-Adoring"

msgid "PERSONA_1014_DESC"
msgstr ""
"You habitually hide your edge and feign weakness, so others often misjudge "
"your strength and how dangerous you really are. Some even bully or humiliate"
" you, only to be spectacularly put in their place."

msgid "PERSONA_1014_NAME"
msgstr "Play Weak, Hide Strong"

msgid "PERSONA_1015_DESC"
msgstr ""
"You have a natural curiosity and affinity toward cultivators of other races,"
" and are willing to build relationships across differences of origin."

msgid "PERSONA_1015_NAME"
