msgid "RACE_HUMAN_NAME"
msgstr "Human"

msgid "RACE_HUMAN_DESC"
msgstr "You are an ordinary human."

msgid "RACE_HUMAN_BEHAVIOR_DESC"
msgstr ""
"Humans have no yao instinct constraint; their actions are mainly shaped by "
"personality, objectives, sect, alignment, and current circumstances."

msgid "RACE_FOX_NAME"
msgstr "Fox Yao"

msgid "RACE_FOX_DESC"
msgstr ""
"Fox yao are naturally clever, skilled at reading expressions and moods, "
"often striking in appearance, and commonly seen as having an innate affinity"
" for opportunity and social ties."

msgid "RACE_FOX_BEHAVIOR_DESC"
msgstr ""
"Fox yao actions should first show reading moods, social probing, "
"advantageous trades, and a nose for opportunity. Ordinary personality may "
"only shape the method; it must not turn fox yao into blunt cultivators who "
"do not cultivate relationships."

msgid "RACE_WOLF_NAME"
msgstr "Wolf Yao"

msgid "RACE_WOLF_DESC"
msgstr ""
"Wolf yao have strong bloodlines, value survival, hunting, and battle, "
"possess keen instincts and swift movement, and often temper their "
"cultivation through combat."

msgid "RACE_WOLF_BEHAVIOR_DESC"
msgstr ""
"Wolf yao actions should first show survival, hunting, combat, territory, and"
" judgments of strength. Ordinary personality may only change how they "
"attack; it must not make wolf yao sit in idle discourse for long or avoid "
"all conflict."

msgid "RACE_BIRD_NAME"
msgstr "Bird Yao"

msgid "RACE_BIRD_DESC"
msgstr ""
"Bird yao have broad perception and nimble movement, are born to yearn for "
"distant places, and excel at scouting, escape, and exploring the unknown."

msgid "RACE_BIRD_BEHAVIOR_DESC"
msgstr ""
"Bird yao actions should first show migration, scouting, travel, observation,"
" and evasion. Ordinary personality may only affect route and pace; it must "
"not leave bird yao trapped in one place without cause or abandoning their "
"need for wider sight."

msgid "RACE_SNAKE_NAME"
msgstr "Snake Yao"

msgid "RACE_SNAKE_DESC"
msgstr ""
"Snake yao have subtle auras and patient ways, excel at hiding and ambush, "
"are often feared by human cultivators, and adapt well to dark and dangerous "
"places."

msgid "RACE_SNAKE_BEHAVIOR_DESC"
msgstr ""
"Snake yao actions should first show lurking, patience, probing, indirect "
"routes, and sudden ambush. Ordinary personality may only change how ruthless"
" they are; it must not make snake yao into loud, frontal, openly bustling "
"cultivators."

msgid "RACE_TURTLE_NAME"
msgstr "Turtle Yao"

msgid "RACE_TURTLE_DESC"
msgstr ""
"Turtle yao are long-lived and steady of body, slow and cautious in conduct, "
"and most skilled at defense, recuperation, and long secluded cultivation."

msgid "RACE_TURTLE_BEHAVIOR_DESC"
msgstr ""
"Turtle yao actions should first show slowness, defense, recuperation, rest, "
"and seclusion. Unless avoiding danger, breaking through, fulfilling sect "
"duties, pursuing a clear target, or meeting resource needs, they should not "
"move frequently or initiate conflict; ordinary personality must not override"
" this guarding instinct."

